    "description": {
      "value": "Your mind becomes clear and cognition flows freely, but physical matters seem ephemeral. Benefit You gain an item bonus to Arcana, Crafting, Lore, Occultism, and Society checks and all checks to Recall Knowledge. Your critical failures on Recall Knowledge checks become failures instead. Drawback You take a \u20132 penalty to weapon and unarmed attack rolls, Athletics checks, and Acrobatics checks. You can carry 2 less Bulk than normal before becoming encumbered, and the maximum Bulk you can carry is reduced by 4. The bonus is +2, and the duration is 10 minutes."
